      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "f4c4d051d514270964adcf58e124569e396602340b7d9172671759de10a95897-p1-b15",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 1,
      "text": "AND UPON reviewing the Judgment of H.E. Justice Maha AI Mheiri (the \"Judge\") dated 26 February",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "f4c4d051d514270964adcf58e124569e396602340b7d9172671759de10a95897-p1-b16",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 1,
      "text": "2025 (the \"Judgment\")",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "f4c4d051d514270964adcf58e124569e396602340b7d9172671759de10a95897-p1-b17",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 1,
      "text": "AND UPON reviewing the Defendant's Appeal Notice dated 12 March 2025 seeking permission to",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "f4c4d051d514270964adcf58e124569e396602340b7d9172671759de10a95897-p1-b18",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 1,
      "text": "appeal the Judgment (the \"Application\")",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "f4c4d051d514270964adcf58e124569e396602340b7d9172671759de10a95897-p1-b19",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 1,
      "text": "AND UPON considering the documents and submissions filed by both parties and recorded on the",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "f4c4d051d514270964adcf58e124569e396602340b7d9172671759de10a95897-p1-b20",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 1,
      "text": "case file",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "f4c4d051d514270964adcf58e124569e396602340b7d9172671759de10a95897-p1-b21",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 1,
      "text": "IT IS HEREBY ORDERED THAT:",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "f4c4d051d514270964adcf58e124569e396602340b7d9172671759de10a95897-p1-b22",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 1,
      "text": "1. The request for an oral hearing of the Application is refused.",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "f4c4d051d514270964adcf58e124569e396602340b7d9172671759de10a95897-p1-b23",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 1,
      "text": "2. The Application is refused.",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "f4c4d051d514270964adcf58e124569e396602340b7d9172671759de10a95897-p2-b1",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "3. The Applicant may not request that the decision be reconsidered at a hearing.",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "f4c4d051d514270964adcf58e124569e396602340b7d9172671759de10a95897-p2-b2",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "4. The Applicant shall bear its own costs of the Application.",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "f4c4d051d514270964adcf58e124569e396602340b7d9172671759de10a95897-p2-b3",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "Issued by:",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "f4c4d051d514270964adcf58e124569e396602340b7d9172671759de10a95897-p2-b4",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "Hayley Norton",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "f4c4d051d514270964adcf58e124569e396602340b7d9172671759de10a95897-p2-b5",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "SCT Judge and Assistant Registrar",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "f4c4d051d514270964adcf58e124569e396602340b7d9172671759de10a95897-p2-b6",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "Date of Issue: 25 April 2025",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "f4c4d051d514270964adcf58e124569e396602340b7d9172671759de10a95897-p2-b7",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "At: 2pm",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "f4c4d051d514270964adcf58e124569e396602340b7d9172671759de10a95897-p2-b8",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "SCHEDULE OF REASONS",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "f4c4d051d514270964adcf58e124569e396602340b7d9172671759de10a95897-p2-b9",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "1. By an Application Notice, including the required Application for Permission to Appeal, issued on 12",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "f4c4d051d514270964adcf58e124569e396602340b7d9172671759de10a95897-p2-b10",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "March 2025 (the \"Application\"), the Defendant Applicant and intending Appellant, Onesimo, seeks",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "f4c4d051d514270964adcf58e124569e396602340b7d9172671759de10a95897-p2-b11",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "permission to appeal the Judgment of H.E. Justice Maha Al Mheiri sitting in the Small Claims Tribunal",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "f4c4d051d514270964adcf58e124569e396602340b7d9172671759de10a95897-p2-b12",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "(the \"SCT\" or the \"Iower court\"), of 26 February 2025.",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "f4c4d051d514270964adcf58e124569e396602340b7d9172671759de10a95897-p2-b13",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "2. The Judgment was made upholding certain claims advanced by Oleta (the \"Claimant\" in the lower",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "f4c4d051d514270964adcf58e124569e396602340b7d9172671759de10a95897-p2-b14",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "court and the \"Respondent\" to the Application) made against the Applicant, for payment of her",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "f4c4d051d514270964adcf58e124569e396602340b7d9172671759de10a95897-p2-b15",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "September salary, which the Judge held was due to her under a contract of employment dated 21 May",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "f4c4d051d514270964adcf58e124569e396602340b7d9172671759de10a95897-p2-b16",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "2024.",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "f4c4d051d514270964adcf58e124569e396602340b7d9172671759de10a95897-p2-b17",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "3. The Judgment upheld the Claimant's claim made against the Applicant for payment of the amount",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "f4c4d051d514270964adcf58e124569e396602340b7d9172671759de10a95897-p2-b18",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "of AED 3,466.67 and the Court's fees in the sum of AED 367.25. The Judge also rejected the",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "f4c4d051d514270964adcf58e124569e396602340b7d9172671759de10a95897-p2-b19",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "Applicant's defence of set-off in the amount of AED 10,o0o in respect of alleged training costs",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "f4c4d051d514270964adcf58e124569e396602340b7d9172671759de10a95897-p2-b20",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "allegedly payable to it by the Claimant.",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "f4c4d051d514270964adcf58e124569e396602340b7d9172671759de10a95897-p2-b21",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "4. By her Judgment, the learned Judge ordered as follows:",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "f4c4d051d514270964adcf58e124569e396602340b7d9172671759de10a95897-p2-b22",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "\"1. The Defendant's request for AED 10,o00 in relation to training costs is denied.",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "f4c4d051d514270964adcf58e124569e396602340b7d9172671759de10a95897-p2-b23",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "2. The Defendant shall pay the Claimant the amount of AED 3,466.67 for her September Salary.",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "f4c4d051d514270964adcf58e124569e396602340b7d9172671759de10a95897-p2-b24",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "3. The Defendant shall pay the Claimant the Court fee in the sum of AED 367.25.",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "f4c4d051d514270964adcf58e124569e396602340b7d9172671759de10a95897-p2-b25",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "5. In its Application, the Applicant had requested an oral hearing. Under the Rules of the Dubai",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "f4c4d051d514270964adcf58e124569e396602340b7d9172671759de10a95897-p2-b26",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "International Financial Centre Courts 2014 (the \"RDC\"), it is provided as follows in relation to",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "f4c4d051d514270964adcf58e124569e396602340b7d9172671759de10a95897-p2-b27",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "applications for permission of appeal being considered without a hearing",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "f4c4d051d514270964adcf58e124569e396602340b7d9172671759de10a95897-p2-b28",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "\"Consideration of Permission without a Hearing 53.94 - 53.100",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "f4c4d051d514270964adcf58e124569e396602340b7d9172671759de10a95897-p2-b29",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "53.94",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "f4c4d051d514270964adcf58e124569e396602340b7d9172671759de10a95897-p2-b30",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "Application for permission to appeal may be considered by the Court of First Instance without a",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "f4c4d051d514270964adcf58e124569e396602340b7d9172671759de10a95897-p2-b31",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "hearing.\"",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "f4c4d051d514270964adcf58e124569e396602340b7d9172671759de10a95897-p2-b32",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "6. The Court thus has the power to decide an application for permission to appeal on the papers,",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "f4c4d051d514270964adcf58e124569e396602340b7d9172671759de10a95897-p2-b33",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "without the need for an oral hearing. Having reviewed the materials presently before the Court, I am",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "f4c4d051d514270964adcf58e124569e396602340b7d9172671759de10a95897-p2-b34",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "satisfied that the merits and prospects of success on appeal are so manifestly lacking that it would be",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "f4c4d051d514270964adcf58e124569e396602340b7d9172671759de10a95897-p3-b1",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 3,
      "text": "inappropriate and not consistent with attainment of the overriding objective, to devote judicial",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "f4c4d051d514270964adcf58e124569e396602340b7d9172671759de10a95897-p3-b2",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 3,
      "text": "resources to the holding of a hearing. I therefore determine this Application on the papers before me.",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "f4c4d051d514270964adcf58e124569e396602340b7d9172671759de10a95897-p3-b3",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 3,
      "text": "The reasons why I have reached this conclusion are set out in the following paragraphs.",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "f4c4d051d514270964adcf58e124569e396602340b7d9172671759de10a95897-p3-b4",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 3,
      "text": "7. Under RDC 53.87, the \"Court\", meaning the Court to which an appeal is made, will allow an appeal",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "f4c4d051d514270964adcf58e124569e396602340b7d9172671759de10a95897-p3-b5",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 3,
      "text": "where the decision of the lower court was:",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "f4c4d051d514270964adcf58e124569e396602340b7d9172671759de10a95897-p3-b6",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 3,
      "text": "(1)wrong;",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "f4c4d051d514270964adcf58e124569e396602340b7d9172671759de10a95897-p3-b7",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 3,
      "text": "(2) unjust because of a serious procedural or other irregularity in the proceedings; or",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "f4c4d051d514270964adcf58e124569e396602340b7d9172671759de10a95897-p3-b8",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 3,
      "text": "(3) wrong in relation to any other matter provided for or under any law.\"",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "f4c4d051d514270964adcf58e124569e396602340b7d9172671759de10a95897-p3-b9",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 3,
      "text": "8. By RDC 53.89, an application for permission to appeal a decision of the SCT, must be made to the",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "f4c4d051d514270964adcf58e124569e396602340b7d9172671759de10a95897-p3-b10",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 3,
      "text": "Court of First Instance in a particular form, and under RDC 53.91, permission to appeal may only be",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "f4c4d051d514270964adcf58e124569e396602340b7d9172671759de10a95897-p3-b11",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 3,
      "text": "granted by me as a judge of the Court of First Instance:",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "f4c4d051d514270964adcf58e124569e396602340b7d9172671759de10a95897-p3-b12",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 3,
      "text": "\"Where:",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "f4c4d051d514270964adcf58e124569e396602340b7d9172671759de10a95897-p3-b13",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 3,
      "text": "(1) the Court considers that the appeal would have a real prospect of success; or",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "f4c4d051d514270964adcf58e124569e396602340b7d9172671759de10a95897-p3-b14",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 3,
      "text": "(2) there is some other compelling reason why the appeal should be heard.\"",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "f4c4d051d514270964adcf58e124569e396602340b7d9172671759de10a95897-p3-b15",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 3,
      "text": "9. Application of that test, or satisfaction that its requirements have been met, obviously requires a",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "f4c4d051d514270964adcf58e124569e396602340b7d9172671759de10a95897-p3-b16",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 3,
      "text": "prospective inquiry and assessment. In short, an applicant/intending appellant must show that there is",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "f4c4d051d514270964adcf58e124569e396602340b7d9172671759de10a95897-p3-b17",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 3,
      "text": "a real (i.e. a realistic as opposed to a fanciful) prospect of persuading an Appeal Court, that the judge",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "f4c4d051d514270964adcf58e124569e396602340b7d9172671759de10a95897-p3-b18",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 3,
      "text": "of first instance, in the Small Claims Tribunal was wrong in what she decided. This requirement must",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "f4c4d051d514270964adcf58e124569e396602340b7d9172671759de10a95897-p3-b19",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 3,
      "text": "be satisfied by the grounds of appeal advanced, and the written submissions made showing that the",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "f4c4d051d514270964adcf58e124569e396602340b7d9172671759de10a95897-p3-b20",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 3,
      "text": "Judge erred in her findings and decision.",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "f4c4d051d514270964adcf58e124569e396602340b7d9172671759de10a95897-p3-b21",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 3,
      "text": "10. In this case, there is simply no prospect in my judgment of this Applicant showing on an appeal,",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "f4c4d051d514270964adcf58e124569e396602340b7d9172671759de10a95897-p3-b22",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 3,
      "text": "that the Judge was wrong in what she decided on the issue of reimbursement of training costs; or",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "f4c4d051d514270964adcf58e124569e396602340b7d9172671759de10a95897-p3-b23",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 3,
      "text": "made her decision in a manner that was unjust.",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "f4c4d051d514270964adcf58e124569e396602340b7d9172671759de10a95897-p3-b24",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 3,
      "text": "11. The Judge was entitled to interpret Article 4 Clause 2 in the employment contract in the manner",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "f4c4d051d514270964adcf58e124569e396602340b7d9172671759de10a95897-p3-b25",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 3,
      "text": "that she did, as only applying so as to entitle the employer to recover training expenses actually",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "f4c4d051d514270964adcf58e124569e396602340b7d9172671759de10a95897-p3-b26",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 3,
      "text": "incurred and charged to the company for training services provided to the employee, by an external",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "f4c4d051d514270964adcf58e124569e396602340b7d9172671759de10a95897-p3-b27",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 3,
      "text": "provider. Further, she was entitled to conclude that any cost of basic internal training delivered by",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "f4c4d051d514270964adcf58e124569e396602340b7d9172671759de10a95897-p3-b28",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 3,
      "text": "fellow employees \"on the job\" so to speak, was not within the parties' objectively ascertained",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "f4c4d051d514270964adcf58e124569e396602340b7d9172671759de10a95897-p3-b29",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 3,
      "text": "intentions for reimbursement of training costs expressed in that clause.",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "f4c4d051d514270964adcf58e124569e396602340b7d9172671759de10a95897-p3-b30",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 3,
      "text": "12. Furthermore, she was entitled to conclude on the evidence before her, that the Defendant",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "f4c4d051d514270964adcf58e124569e396602340b7d9172671759de10a95897-p3-b31",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 3,
      "text": "Applicant had not proved that it had incurred such recoverable expenses or that any training went",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "f4c4d051d514270964adcf58e124569e396602340b7d9172671759de10a95897-p3-b32",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 3,
      "text": "beyond the essential and ordinary internal training provided by any employer to understand the",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "f4c4d051d514270964adcf58e124569e396602340b7d9172671759de10a95897-p3-b33",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 3,
      "text": "requirements of the employment and perform the job.",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "f4c4d051d514270964adcf58e124569e396602340b7d9172671759de10a95897-p4-b1",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 4,
      "text": "13. In the Notice of Appeal, the Defendant Applicant now raises additional claims against the Claimant",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "f4c4d051d514270964adcf58e124569e396602340b7d9172671759de10a95897-p4-b2",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 4,
      "text": "for: (i) failure to fulfil the three-month notice period as per her employment contract and (ii) visa cost",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "f4c4d051d514270964adcf58e124569e396602340b7d9172671759de10a95897-p4-b3",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 4,
      "text": "recovery as per article 57(2) and article 63 of DIFC Employment Law. Those grounds of appeal have",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "f4c4d051d514270964adcf58e124569e396602340b7d9172671759de10a95897-p4-b4",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 4,
      "text": "not been the subject of any claim or counterclaim by it and were not before the Judge for her",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "f4c4d051d514270964adcf58e124569e396602340b7d9172671759de10a95897-p4-b5",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 4,
      "text": "determination. It is not permissible to raise these new counterclaims on an application for permission",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "f4c4d051d514270964adcf58e124569e396602340b7d9172671759de10a95897-p4-b6",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 4,
      "text": "to appeal. The Applicant also adverts to the existence of evidence of costs incurred from an external",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "f4c4d051d514270964adcf58e124569e396602340b7d9172671759de10a95897-p4-b7",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 4,
      "text": "training provider, which it says it is willing to produce; but even now has not produced. Such evidence,",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "f4c4d051d514270964adcf58e124569e396602340b7d9172671759de10a95897-p4-b8",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 4,
      "text": "even if it were available, ought to have been produced for the hearing before the Judge and no reason",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "f4c4d051d514270964adcf58e124569e396602340b7d9172671759de10a95897-p4-b9",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 4,
      "text": "is advanced why it could not have been produced. It is not even produced and appended to the Notice",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "f4c4d051d514270964adcf58e124569e396602340b7d9172671759de10a95897-p4-b10",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 4,
      "text": "of Appeal at this late stage. There is no prospect that the Applicant would be allowed to rely on such",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "f4c4d051d514270964adcf58e124569e396602340b7d9172671759de10a95897-p4-b11",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 4,
      "text": "fresh evidence, not produced before the SCT, on the hearing of an appeal.",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "f4c4d051d514270964adcf58e124569e396602340b7d9172671759de10a95897-p4-b12",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 4,
      "text": "14. In those circumstances, there is no realistic prospect of the Applicant succeeding on appeal",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "f4c4d051d514270964adcf58e124569e396602340b7d9172671759de10a95897-p4-b13",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 4,
      "text": "against the Judge's decision that it is not entitled to set-off the alleged training costs it claimed it had",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "f4c4d051d514270964adcf58e124569e396602340b7d9172671759de10a95897-p4-b14",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 4,
      "text": "incurred in relation to the Claimant, against the final salary payment which the Judge ordered it to pay",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "f4c4d051d514270964adcf58e124569e396602340b7d9172671759de10a95897-p4-b15",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 4,
      "text": "to the Claimant. Permission to appeal is therefore refused. The Court is also satisfied that the",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "f4c4d051d514270964adcf58e124569e396602340b7d9172671759de10a95897-p4-b16",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 4,
      "text": "Application is in fact and law, totally without merit within the meaning, and for the purposes of RDC",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "f4c4d051d514270964adcf58e124569e396602340b7d9172671759de10a95897-p4-b17",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 4,
      "text": "53.99. That rule empowers the Court to order that the Applicant may not request that this decision to",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "f4c4d051d514270964adcf58e124569e396602340b7d9172671759de10a95897-p4-b18",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 4,
      "text": "refuse permission to appeal, be reconsidered at a hearing. Accordingly, the Court has made an order",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "f4c4d051d514270964adcf58e124569e396602340b7d9172671759de10a95897-p4-b19",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 4,
      "text": "to that effect.",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "f4c4d051d514270964adcf58e124569e396602340b7d9172671759de10a95897-p4-b20",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 4,
      "text": "15. This Court also notes the Claimant's contention before the Court, that the Applicant is in breach of",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "f4c4d051d514270964adcf58e124569e396602340b7d9172671759de10a95897-p4-b21",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 4,
      "text": "the order by consent of SCT Judge Maitha Alshehhi, of 30 October 2024, (the \"Order\") that the",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "f4c4d051d514270964adcf58e124569e396602340b7d9172671759de10a95897-p4-b22",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 4,
      "text": "Defendant shall proceed to cancel the Claimant's employment visa. If the Applicant remains in breach",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "f4c4d051d514270964adcf58e124569e396602340b7d9172671759de10a95897-p4-b23",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 4,
      "text": "of that Order, which is an unconditional mandatory Order of the SCT, its breach should be drawn to the",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "f4c4d051d514270964adcf58e124569e396602340b7d9172671759de10a95897-p4-b24",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 4,
      "text": "attention of Judge Maitha Alshehhi so she may decide what, if any, action should be taken of the",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "f4c4d051d514270964adcf58e124569e396602340b7d9172671759de10a95897-p4-b25",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 4,
      "text": "SCT's own motion, to enforce the Order.",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    }
  ],
  "tables": []
}
